OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fsome clear spells this evening, and
OL,7,Fbriefly chilly. However, cloud
OL,8,Fthickening from the east overnight
OL,9,Fwith outbreaks of rain arriving, some
OL,10,Fperhaps heavy. Temperatures rising a
OL,11,Flittle later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA cloudy start to Monday with
OL,14,Fsome rain, this clearing to the north
OL,15,Fand west through the morning. Sunny
OL,16,Fperiods developing in the afternoon.
OL,17,FFeeling pleasant in the light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
