OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FUnsettled with outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Fdeveloping at times on Tuesday into
OL,8,FWednesday. Some brighter spells around
OL,9,Fon Thursday, though with showers too.
OL,10,FBecoming windy, with coastal gales
OL,11,Fpossible, especially later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
